WEBVTT

00:15:30.491 --> 00:15:34.395
Hoću da gledam oblake dok prolaze

00:15:38.822 --> 00:15:43.702
Možda mi smanji teret

00:15:46.458 --> 00:15:50.705
Gospode, Gospode, Gospode
Gde ću biti sutra veče?

00:15:54.744 --> 00:15:57.262
Baš tako

00:15:57.286 --> 00:15:58.596
Budite slobodni

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:03.127
Baš tako, budite slobodni